# (b) Worst-case random bad luck that still survives.
# Outbound has one hazard, so the worst it can do alone is a severe drift
# (+10); the round-trip cap is +12, so the return leg can add at most 2 more.
# Worst random landing: Sol 35, ten Sols inside the Sol-45 deadline.
seed 7                          # the overclock fails: severe drift +10
orders caretaker
run-to 10
split cal,jonathan,dax
close
launch
fly overclock
screenshot holding
expect sol 25
expect fuel 500
expect delay 10
expect random-delay 10
expect machine hab_01 nominal
expect machine hab_02 nominal
expect stress maya calm
close
screenshot colony-after-catchup
# Milestone 6 from here.
dock
haggle carbon-filters
return                          # at most +2 more random Sols
land
expect sol 35
screenshot blackbox
install-filters
screenshot rain
